  "anchors": [
    {
      "id": "Q1",
      "source": "mof2025qa",
      "locator": "Q1: background",
      "quote": "规定自2023年1月1日起在境内外同时上市以及在境外上市并采用国际财务报告准则或企业会计准则编制财务报表的企业执行，其他执行企业会计准则的企业自2026年1月1日起执行。",
      "whitespace_policy": "Only whitespace removed for matching",
      "claim": "Official explanation reports original entity-class 2023/2026 schedule; direct issuance notice still unavailable"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q2",
      "source": "mof2025qa",
      "locator": "Q2: preparation and issuance",
      "quote": "于2025年6月6日正式印发《通知》。",
      "whitespace_policy": "Only whitespace removed for matching",
      "claim": "Stated issuance date differs from explanatory-page date"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q3",
      "source": "mof2025qa",
      "locator": "Q3: implementation arrangements",
      "quote": "以及在本《通知》施行前根据财会〔2020〕20号已提前执行的企业，应当继续执行新保险合同会计准则",
      "whitespace_policy": "Only whitespace removed for matching",
      "claim": "Existing adopters, including qualifying earlier adopters, continue applying"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q4",
      "source": "mof2025qa",
      "locator": "Q3: implementation arrangements",
      "quote": "确有困难需暂缓执行的保险公司应当向财政部会计司和金融监管总局机构监管司局提交书面材料说明原因。",
      "whitespace_policy": "Only whitespace removed for matching",
      "claim": "Difficulty requires written explanatory materials to both named authorities; no automatic blanket deferral inferred"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q5",
      "source": "mof2025qa",
      "locator": "Q5: relationship to standard",
      "quote": "仅适用于非上市企业。对于《通知》中未涉及的交易或事项，非上市企业应当按照新保险合同会计准则进行会计处理。",
      "whitespace_policy": "Only whitespace removed for matching",
      "claim": "Simplification choices limited to unlisted entities; uncovered matters follow the standard"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q6",
      "source": "mof2025qa",
      "locator": "Q5: transition simplifications",
      "quote": "对首次执行新保险合同会计准则时比较信息的列报、修正追溯调整法下简化衔接处理方法的应用以及过渡日的确定等作出简化规定。",
      "whitespace_policy": "Only whitespace removed for matching",
      "claim": "Explanation identifies transition subjects, not full implementable conditions"
    },
    {
